## 📚 6. DEPENDENCY & LIBRARY

### Centralized Version Management
Semua dependency versions ada di `gradle/libs.versions.toml`:

```toml
[versions]
agp = "9.1.1"                    # Android Gradle Plugin
coreKtx = "1.10.1"               # AndroidX Core
appcompat = "1.6.1"              # AppCompat
material = "1.10.0"              # Material Design 3
activity = "1.8.0"               # Activity Library
constraintlayout = "2.1.4"       # ConstraintLayout

[libraries]
androidx-core-ktx = { group = "androidx.core", name = "core-ktx", version.ref = "coreKtx" }
androidx-appcompat = { group = "androidx.appcompat", name = "appcompat", version.ref = "appcompat" }
material = { group = "com.google.android.material", name = "material", version.ref = "material" }
androidx-activity = { group = "androidx.activity", name = "activity", version.ref = "activity" }
androidx-constraintlayout = { group = "androidx.constraintlayout", name = "constraintlayout", version.ref = "constraintlayout" }

[plugins]
android-application = { id = "com.android.application", version.ref = "agp" }
```

### Menggunakan Dependencies

```kotlin
// Di build.gradle.kts
dependencies {
    // Gunakan version catalog
    implementation(libs.androidx.core.ktx)
    implementation(libs.androidx.appcompat)
    implementation(libs.material)
    
    // Testing
    testImplementation(libs.junit)
    androidTestImplementation(libs.androidx.junit)
    androidTestImplementation(libs.androidx.espresso.core)
}
```

### Library Recommendations

Untuk fitur-fitur yang akan digunakan:

| Fitur | Library | Versi |
|-------|---------|-------|
| **Networking** | Retrofit | Latest (Tambah ke libs.versions.toml) |
| **Image Loading** | Coil / Glide | Latest |
| **Database** | Room | androidx.room:room-runtime |
| **Async** | Coroutines | org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines |
| **Dependency Injection** | Hilt | com.google.dagger:hilt-android |
| **Camera** | CameraX | androidx.camera:camera-core |
